---
{
  title: "subjective"
}
---
### NAME

    subjective() - Gets the subjective pronoun for a gender.

### SYNOPSIS

    string subjective( mixed ob );

### DESCRIPTION

    Gets the subjective pronoun for a gender.

### RETURN VALUES

    (string) Subjective pronoun (he/she/it/they)

### EXAMPLE

    {{di1}}subjective("female");  // Returns "she"{{di0}}
